{"id":"b1a3c18aaa9b0194","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-cylinder-characterization.md","title":"柱性的乘积表征","display":"thm-cylinder-characterization — 柱性的乘积表征","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-cylinder-characterization","aliases":["20-thm-cylinder-characterization"],"display":"thm-cylinder-characterization — 柱性的乘积表征","chapter":"1","section":"1.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 1.6.27(ii),(iii)","source_printed_pages":[19],"source_pdf_pages":[55],"depends_on":["[[20-df-cylinder]]","[[20-df-m-one-degrees]]","[[20-df-pairing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-cylinder-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-cylinder-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cylinder-characterization — 柱性的乘积表征"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 1.6.27(ii),(iii)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>19</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>55</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4829719bf9cdd6dd\" href=\"?note=4829719bf9cdd6dd\" title=\"20-df-cylinder\">20-df-cylinder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8746557b9bf84a4b\" href=\"?note=8746557b9bf84a4b\" title=\"20-df-m-one-degrees\">20-df-m-one-degrees</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\times\\omega\">\\(B\\times\\omega\\)</span> 以配对编码为自然数集合。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4829719bf9cdd6dd\" href=\"?note=4829719bf9cdd6dd\" title=\"20-df-cylinder\">20-df-cylinder</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8746557b9bf84a4b\" href=\"?note=8746557b9bf84a4b\" title=\"20-df-m-one-degrees\">20-df-m-one-degrees</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cylinder\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Cylinder}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists B\\subseteq\\omega\\ [A\\equiv_1 B\\times\\omega].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cylinder\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Cylinder}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists B\\subseteq\\omega\\ [A\\equiv_1 B\\times\\omega].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 C≤m B×ω 经 f，令 f(x)=〈u(x),v(x)〉，改用 x↦〈u(x),x〉便得到单射见证，所以每个 B×ω 是柱。柱性由 1 等价传递。反向若 A 是柱，A×ω≤m A，经投影，故 A×ω≤1 A；另有 A≤1 A×ω，经 x↦〈x,0〉。取 B=A。空集与全集也适用。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 1.6.27(ii),(iii)；印刷页 19；PDF 第 55 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"4829719bf9cdd6dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-m-one-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"8746557b9bf84a4b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-m-one-degrees]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"4829719bf9cdd6dd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cylinder]]；see [[20-df-m-one-degrees]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-m-one-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"8746557b9bf84a4b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cylinder]]；see [[20-df-m-one-degrees]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cylinder]]；see [[20-df-m-one-degrees]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"B\\times\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cylinder\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Cylinder}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists B\\subseteq\\omega\\ [A\\equiv_1 B\\times\\omega].","display":true}],"bytes":1378,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["4829719bf9cdd6dd","8746557b9bf84a4b","35073b74f84433b3"]}